<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">pour your wine on (holy fires that you fled)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œIâ€™m sorry I stared,â€ George said after what felt like eons. â€œI justâ€”I knew someone else who had scars like those.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adoraâ€™s hand tightened over the book, her breath coming out in harsh gasps. &lt;i&gt;He knows he knows he knows he knows he knows he knows&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œThey were on his back though.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adoraâ€™s brow furrowed, â€œHis back?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;George nodded, â€œHe never said where he got them. Told me it was an accident he had as a child.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œI have some on my back too,â€ Adora said. And her arms, her legs, and running up her neck.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œIt wasnâ€™t an accident, was it,â€ George said.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora looked back down at the book and elected not to answer. George sighed and walked a little ways away, out of earshot of Adoraâ€™s pounding heart.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Who was he? She thought all this time that it was just her but what ifâ€”what if Shadow Weaver had others? Should she feel relieved? Betrayed?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She just felt numb.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra was arguing with Glimmer about something, Adora couldnâ€™t tell what. The gray tufts behind her ears looked soft. Adora looked down at the book again and pretended to read it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or:&lt;br /&gt;the most visible scars on Adora are not the most painful, nor the most debilitating. The war isn't over yet.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>womenlovingwonderwoman (The_Camel_Queen)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Bow &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
